OL,3,GNEWSABroadcaster uncovers tale of WWI
OL,4,Achoir star
OL,5,
OL,6,FA promising Derbyshire chorister who
OL,7,Fgave up his musical career to serve in
OL,8,FWorld War One is being remembered more
OL,9,Fthan a century after his death.
OL,11,FHistorian and broadcaster David Olusoga
OL,12,Fhas uncovered the story of Frank
OL,13,FReginald Froggatt from Eyam, after
OL,14,Fresearching names on the village's war
OL,15,Fmemorial.
OL,17,FBorn in 1888, Froggatt grew up in a
OL,18,Ffamily with deep musical roots, became
OL,19,Fa choirmaster and went on to tour the
OL,20,Fworld. He dropped his music career to
OL,21,Fenlist in WWI in 1914 and died in
OL,22,Fmodern-day Iraq in 1917.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
